{"id":"e517fe7e67906b13","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/888_BCK_逻辑.md","title":"888 BCK 逻辑","display":"888_BCK_逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"888-BCK-逻辑\">888 BCK 逻辑</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为固定可数无限命题原子集合。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\)</span>。BCK 在后文含 B、C、K 公理而令 W 公理族为空。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式、自由原子与替换\">2. 公式、自由原子与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{BCK}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{BCK}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-公理族\">3. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-分离规则\">4. 分离规则</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\\)</span>。分离规则关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 的子集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\n=\n\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B));B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\n=\n\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B));B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-证明序列\">5. 证明序列</h1>\n<p>从假设集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 出发的 BCK 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 满足以下之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=\\operatorname{imp}(A_j,A_i)\">\\(A_k=\\operatorname{imp}(A_j,A_i)\\)</span>，等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1}):\\pi\\text{ 是从 }\\Gamma\\text{ 出发的 BCK 证明且 }A_{n-1}=A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1}):\\pi\\text{ 是从 }\\Gamma\\text{ 出发的 BCK 证明且 }A_{n-1}=A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-可导性\">6. 可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BCK}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BCK}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对判断对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,A)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\((\\Gamma,A)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-定理集合\">7. 定理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BCK}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BCK}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标差异是：公理基底恰含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\\)</span>，并显式令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}=\\varnothing\\)</span>；因而保留弱化型 K 而排除收缩型 W。</p>\n<p>BCK 的公理差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\mathsf B)=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\mathsf C)=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\mathsf K)=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\mathsf W)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\mathsf B)=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\mathsf C)=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\mathsf K)=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(\\mathsf W)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf B\">\\(\\mathsf B\\)</span> 表示组合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C\">\\(\\mathsf C\\)</span> 表示交换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K\">\\(\\mathsf K\\)</span> 表示弱化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf W\">\\(\\mathsf W\\)</span> 表示收缩。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{BCK}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{BCK}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{C},\\mathsf{Ax}_{K},\\mathsf{Ax}_{W},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\operatorname{Struct}_{\\mathsf{BCK}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 BCK 的蕴含句法证明关系；不含 W 收缩公理、代数语义或组合子归约语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"888-BCK-逻辑","text":"888 BCK 逻辑","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式、自由原子与替换","text":"2. 公式、自由原子与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-公理族","text":"3. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"4.-分离规则","text":"4. 分离规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-证明序列","text":"5. 证明序列","level":1},{"id":"6.-可导性","text":"6. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"7.-定理集合","text":"7. 定理集合","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{imp}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}","display":true},{"tex":"A[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BCK}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{BCK}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,\\operatorname{imp}(B,C)),\\operatorname{imp}(B,\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,